# SHADOW VEIL — Chapter III: Crimson Maple Pass

scene intro
  lock
  fade 1 0
  letterbox 1 0
  player face right
  player pose stand
  music silent
  camera player 3 -2 1.2 0
  wait 0.8
  narrate "Rei followed the captives' boat upriver for two days. On the third morning the river turned to rapids, and the road turned to the mountains."
  narrate "Beyond the maple pass stands Castle Hakuro. The pass belongs to the Crow Band, and no convoy crosses it without paying in blood or rice."
  fade 0 3.0 nowait
  wait 1.6
  camera player 12 -3 0.85 4 nowait
  say REI "Hakuro's men took the captives up this road. The crows let them pass."
  say REI "Or they couldn't stop them."
  camera player 3 -2 1.0 1.5
  title "第三章" "Chapter III — Crimson Maple Pass" 4.5
  letterbox 0 1.2
  camera_release
  unlock
  hint crow
  request save
end

scene bridge_duel
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.6
  camera player 14 -1 0.95 1.8
  say SOLDIER "Stop there. This bridge belongs to the Crow Band."
  say REI "I'm not here for your bridge. Hakuro's men took people from Minase."
  say SOLDIER "Everyone who comes up this road is looking for someone. Draw, or go back down."
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.6
  unlock
end

scene hamlet
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.8
  camera npc:exile1 -2 -1 1.05 2.2
  wait 0.6
  say REI "A village. Up here."
  npc exile1 face left
  say EXILE "Stay where you are, stitcher. We can see the thread-mark on your blade from here."
  say REI "I haven't come to hurt anyone."
  say EXILE "Your people said that once. Six hundred years ago, they said it to my great-grandmother's great-grandmother, and then they sewed the sky shut behind her."
  say EXILE "We are from the Hollow. The Veil is wearing thin. Some of us walked out through the tears."
  say EXILE "Karasu keeps us hidden. The crows raid Hakuro's carts so the children eat. That is the whole of our crime."
  say REI "…I was told the Hollow held monsters."
  say EXILE "Look around. Count them."
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.8
  unlock
  request save
end

scene exile_talk
  say EXILE "Rest by the fire if you like. Karasu will want to see you himself, up at the Roost."
  say EXILE "Be careful with him. He fights like the wind on this ridge — from everywhere at once."
end

scene exile_mason
  say EXILE "I cut stone on the other side, before. Hakuro's men pay nothing for it here; they just take the cutter."
  say EXILE "Every pair of hands in the valley is building that road. It runs past the castle, up to where the Veil is thinnest."
end

scene boss_intro
  lock
  letterbox 1 1.0
  music silent
  camera boss -4 -1 1.0 2.2
  wait 0.4
  say KARASU "My scouts said a Kagenui was climbing the pass. I didn't believe them. You were supposed to be extinct."
  say REI "I'm looking for the captives from Minase."
  say KARASU "They went over the ridge a day ago. I counted the chains."
  say REI "And you let them pass."
  say KARASU "Forty spears and a gun-line, against my people? I am not a fool. But I won't let a stitcher walk past my village either."
  say KARASU "Your kind sewed us in once. Show me you're different, or show me you're the same."
  sfx perilous
  shake 0.4
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.8
  unlock
  boss_start
end

scene boss_phase2
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.4
  camera boss 0 -1 1.1 0.6
  say KARASU "Ha! Good. Then let the wind take a turn."
  shake 0.5
  wait 0.4
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.4
  unlock
end

scene boss_outro
  lock
  letterbox 1 1.0
  music elegy
  wait 1.4
  camera boss 0 -1 1.3 2.2
  say KARASU "…Go on. That is what your blade is for."
  say REI "I saw your village. The children by the fire."
  say REI "Get up, Karasu."
  wait 0.8
  say KARASU "…So you are different. Or you are only young."
  say KARASU "Listen, then. Your master came over this pass a month ago. The old man in straw."
  say KARASU "He told me the Veil would come down within the year, and that every exile could walk home in the daylight."
  say REI "Odaka said that?"
  say KARASU "He said there is someone inside the Veil who has been holding it closed for twenty years. Someone he means to bring out. Hakuro's road leads him there."
  say KARASU "Take this mask. My scouts will know you by it, and let you pass."
  toast "Crow Mask" "Token acquired"
  wait 0.6
  narrate "Over the ridge, the white walls of Castle Hakuro caught the last of the sun."
  wait 0.6
  fade 1 2.5
  wait 0.4
  request chapter_end
end

scene thunder_awaken
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.5
  slowmo 0.4 1.2
  camera player 0 -1 1.3 1.0
  flash 0.6 fff2c0
  shake 0.4
  wait 0.6
  say REI "The storm doesn't choose. It waits for the moment, and then it falls."
  toast "Thunder Stance awakened" "An Execution calls lightning down on up to three nearby foes."
  hint thunder
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.5
  unlock
  request save
end
